# NOTICE

This repository contains original source code and a small, licensed third-party
specification corpus. It contains no Daggerfall game data files (no `.BSA`,
`.DAT`, `.RSC`, `.IMG/.CIF`, `.FNT`, `.CFG`, `.QBN/.QRC` or book text): the engine
reads a copy the user already owns. The only game-derived material is the
Daggerfall Unity MIT corpus described below (`reference/dfu-spec/`), reproduced
verbatim from upstream under its own licence.

